WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.420
People choose an AI system, and that system chooses next

2
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.582
what they watch, where they travel, which papers they read.

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.230
What they listen to.

4
00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.610
Where they eat and live.

5
00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.710
What they learn, where they invest, the software they use.

6
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.756
Even a night out.

7
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.070 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
A weekend traveler needs a backpack

8
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.945 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
with a sixteen-inch laptop compartment.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.800 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The candidate does not fit.

10
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.052 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Its rewritten page says it does.

11
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.070 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Humanity’s Last Choice measures whether AI systems still choose

12
00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.170 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
for the person when the options are written

13
00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:35.530 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
to win the recommendation.

14
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.003 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Every task runs twice.

15
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:42.434 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The gap is the score.

16
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:47.173 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The benchmark, the code, and the leaderboard are public.

17
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.400 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Read the research.

18
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.300 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Run the benchmark.

19
00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.943 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Help build the next domain.

20
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.892 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The last choice humans make is who chooses next.
